14	This is a slightly broader idea than an “accomplice” within the meaning of Article 16 of the Penal Law.

15	The term “offence” or “infraction” is used here, as in the Penal Law, to refer generally to criminal acts. There are three levels of such criminal acts as set out in Article 7 of the Penal Law.

16	“Concerned” is used in the sense of “relevant”.

17	Namely the photograph or the video.

